&lt;li&gt;  Cleaner UI for filters and controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;  Great for mobile and touch devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;  Easy to combine with real-time previews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




