&lt;h3&gt;


  Best Practices
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;  Always show current selected value nearby&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;  Add labels for min/max values when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;  Use steps for controlled increments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;  Make thumbs large enough for touch devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;  Avoid sliders for extremely precise inputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;  Use disabled state clearly when interaction is blocked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




